     "\r\n<div>\r\n<div><font face=\"arial\" size=\"2\"><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\">Hi everyone,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\">This is the <strong>final call</strong> to join the Physalia course <strong>&quot;A Practical Hands-On Introduction to R with the tidyverse&quot;</strong><br>Dates: <strong>2–4 June 2025</strong> | 14:00–19:00 Berlin time</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\">Course website: <a title=\"This external link will open in a new window\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/r-tidyverse/\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/r-tidyverse/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792483207926000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Z4MBBhI697XAYMEQdAJPQ\">https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/r-tidyverse/</a></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\">Whether\r\n you&#39;re completely new to coding or looking to strengthen your data \r\nwrangling and visualization skills, this course will give you the tools \r\nyou need to work confidently with R — all in a <strong>friendly, interactive</strong> environment.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\">Over 3 days, you&#39;ll learn how to:</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<ul><li>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\">Import, transform, and visualize data with the <strong>tidyverse</strong></p>\r\n</li><li>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\">Automate tasks and write functions</p>\r\n</li><li>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\">Create polished reports using <strong>Quarto</strong></p>\r\n</li></ul><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\">Best regards,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\">Carlo</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:trebuchet ms;font-size:10pt\">--------------------<br><br>Carlo Pecoraro, Ph.D<br><br><br>Physalia-courses DIRECTOR<br><br><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">in...@physalia-courses.org</a><br><br>mobile: <a href=\"tel:+49%20176%2045230846\" value=\"+4917645230846\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+49 17645230846</a><br>